{"unit_id":"Terry12138qy__dsh-vision#card-zh","repo":"Terry12138qy/dsh-vision","commit":"a9bbce894547398fe65dc02448a3c3a22d395fbc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision 是一款面向 DSH Web 的识图插件，通过注册 vision 工具，让不具备原生视觉能力的模型分析本地图片或网络图片。用户可以提供图片路径或 URL，并可附带问题，插件会将图片和提示发送给阿里云百炼的多模态模型，返回中文文字描述；主模型调用失败时可切换到智谱备用模型，并对繁忙请求进行重试。它适合需要在 DSH 对话中识别、描述或解读图片的场景。使用需要配置 DASHSCOPE_API_KEY；备用模型凭据可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:17-36","lib/vision.js:121-168"]}
{"unit_id":"Terry12138qy__dsh-vision#card-en","repo":"Terry12138qy/dsh-vision","commit":"a9bbce894547398fe65dc02448a3c3a22d395fbc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision adds a vision tool to DSH Web for analyzing a local image or URL, optionally with a question. It sends the image to Alibaba Cloud Bailian and returns a Chinese description. Busy requests can be retried, and failures can use a configured Zhipu fallback. Configure DASHSCOPE_API_KEY.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:17-36","lib/vision.js:121-168"]}
